(5850729, 850913, 65234, '<td valign="top">Adorable pose and expression.  Would prefer the bird be a bit sharper, at least in the head.</td>', 'Adorable pose and expression.  Would prefer the bird be a bit sharper, at least in the head.', '2010-02-03 10:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
