(5850739, 851248, 65234, '<td valign="top">And there''s still lots more winter to come!<br/> <br/>Think I would have tried to angle myself so the car wasn''t in the shot, and focussed on a foreground branch so the OOF branches made background bokeh.  The icy branches are interesting all by themselves.</td>', 'And there''s still lots more winter to come! Think I would have tried to angle myself so the car wasn''t in the shot, and focussed on a foreground branch so the OOF branches made background bokeh.  The icy branches are interesting all by themselves.', '2010-02-03 10:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
