(5852201, 850645, 17507, '<td valign="top">This photo is subject to a lot of criticism for its technical qualities, but it really does what many other photos in this challenge fail to do: it captures coldness. You''ve met the challenge spectacularly by capturing the pedestrian''s face and the flurry of snow around him. He shivers against the cold as a gust of wind blows, otherwise lost in his daily routine. Here we see a slice of daily urban life in the northern climes, unfiltered by the artistic pretensions that plague so much of photography. You''ve really got something here.</td>', 'This photo is subject to a lot of criticism for its technical qualities, but it really does what many other photos in this challenge fail to do: it captures coldness. You''ve met the challenge spectacularly by capturing the pedestrian''s face and the flurry of snow around him. He shivers against the cold as a gust of wind blows, otherwise lost in his daily routine. Here we see a slice of daily urban life in the northern climes, unfiltered by the artistic pretensions that plague so much of photography. You''ve really got something here.', '2010-02-04 03:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5852203, 850424, 17507, '<td valign="top">This photo looks perfectly desolate and frigid. To the extent that I have my finger on the pulse of the DPC crowd, I might guess that this is earning underwhelming scores--but if so, then I''m equally sure that this is one that DPC undervalues.</td>', 'This photo looks perfectly desolate and frigid. To the extent that I have my finger on the pulse of the DPC crowd, I might guess that this is earning underwhelming scores--but if so, then I''m equally sure that this is one that DPC undervalues.', '2010-02-04 03:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
