(5852560, 851515, 74911, '<td valign="top">The setup and idea are good. The lighting and exposure could have been better in terms of brightness and contrast. Some more sharpness would enhance the image even better. With these corrections, I believe this image would score easily 1 point more what is going to get now.</td>', 'The setup and idea are good. The lighting and exposure could have been better in terms of brightness and contrast. Some more sharpness would enhance the image even better. With these corrections, I believe this image would score easily 1 point more what is going to get now.', '2010-02-04 10:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
