(5853855, 850692, 103142, '<td valign="top">I find this very beautiful! I love the color or the background. Many people might find the leaf distracting (not that you could do anything about it), but I find it adds interest to it. The snow in the front looks a little strange, I assume from the processing, but again, I like it, it gives it more of a painting feel. -9- (I voted earlier)<br/> <br/>I''m awarding a bluebird early (usually do it after the challenges) Here''s a bluebird for a wonderful shot.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I find this very beautiful! I love the color or the background. Many people might find the leaf distracting (not that you could do anything about it), but I find it adds interest to it. The snow in the front looks a little strange, I assume from the processing, but again, I like it, it gives it more of a painting feel. -9- (I voted earlier) I''m awarding a bluebird early (usually do it after the challenges) Here''s a bluebird for a wonderful shot.', '2010-02-05 06:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
