(5855604, 850784, 76598, '<td valign="top">This picture has an incredible amount of potential, but it is out of focus and it really takes it from incredible to not so good.   If it were in focus, the snow was falling and she was looking at the camera....this would be a knock out image.</td>', 'This picture has an incredible amount of potential, but it is out of focus and it really takes it from incredible to not so good.   If it were in focus, the snow was falling and she was looking at the camera....this would be a knock out image.', '2010-02-06 17:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5855605, 850630, 76598, '<td valign="top">I think for this to have worked, the focus needed to be closer to the "front" of the image.  My first impression is that it is an out of focus jumble.  I think it also need more light.</td>', 'I think for this to have worked, the focus needed to be closer to the "front" of the image.  My first impression is that it is an out of focus jumble.  I think it also need more light.', '2010-02-06 17:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
