(5855785, 851642, 10785, '<td valign="top">Here''s some things that stand out about this picture. You got a bowl of ice water on a doily with some orange stuff in it. It doesn''t make a very compelling subject. Throw in a bloody hand or some fingers at least! The white balance is off quite a bit as everything has a blueish tint to it. Otherwise creative with the title, but a little too macabre for my taste.</td>', 'Here''s some things that stand out about this picture. You got a bowl of ice water on a doily with some orange stuff in it. It doesn''t make a very compelling subject. Throw in a bloody hand or some fingers at least! The white balance is off quite a bit as everything has a blueish tint to it. Otherwise creative with the title, but a little too macabre for my taste.', '2010-02-06 19:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
