(5858995, 850893, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cute pic, but comes off a little flat looking to me. I copied it into PaintShop Pro to see, and I found some modest curves, saturation &amp; contrast adjustments really gave this some nice pop.</td>', 'A cute pic, but comes off a little flat looking to me. I copied it into PaintShop Pro to see, and I found some modest curves, saturation & contrast adjustments really gave this some nice pop.', '2010-02-08 13:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5859009, 851771, 83313, '<td valign="top">Rachel should have known that her Facebook post making fun of dad''s musical preferences for Hannah Montana and Selena Gomez would backfire.<br/> <br/>Serious stuff:<br/>The scene outside the door comes across to me better than the rest of it. All the image area inside does not really seem to add anything else to the image for me. If you cropped in closer to the window it would add a lot of detail but the context of the scene would still be clear. JMO, your mileage may vary.</td>', 'Rachel should have known that her Facebook post making fun of dad''s musical preferences for Hannah Montana and Selena Gomez would backfire. Serious stuff:The scene outside the door comes across to me better than the rest of it. All the image area inside does not really seem to add anything else to the image for me. If you cropped in closer to the window it would add a lot of detail but the context of the scene would still be clear. JMO, your mileage may vary.', '2010-02-08 13:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5859016, 850752, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though I also think a little more visual punch would kick it up a bit on the DPC mass appeal meter.</td>', 'Nice, though I also think a little more visual punch would kick it up a bit on the DPC mass appeal meter.', '2010-02-08 13:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
