(5859030, 851763, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very retro looking. Haven''t seen this on store shelves in Texas yet, but we can get the Cokes from Mexico that are still made with cane sugar and come in those wonderful green glass bottles.</td>', 'Very retro looking. Haven''t seen this on store shelves in Texas yet, but we can get the Cokes from Mexico that are still made with cane sugar and come in those wonderful green glass bottles.', '2010-02-08 13:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
