(5859780, 851699, 99981, '<td valign="top">Top 3 for me. Amazing composition, beautiful colors and textures. I really hope you receive a ribbon. 10 from me.</td>', 'Top 3 for me. Amazing composition, beautiful colors and textures. I really hope you receive a ribbon. 10 from me.', '2010-02-08 20:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5859868, 851642, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is likely to come in toward the back end of the challenge. The depth of field is fairly shallow, and what is in focus comes off quite soft without a lot of detail and clarity. The cropping also seems a bit tight. My suggestion would be to get in closer to get some of the finer detail of the ice and "blood" in the pic. Shooting with a higher F-stop and not as much of an angle to the bowl would help to have more in focus.</td>', 'I''m afraid this is likely to come in toward the back end of the challenge. The depth of field is fairly shallow, and what is in focus comes off quite soft without a lot of detail and clarity. The cropping also seems a bit tight. My suggestion would be to get in closer to get some of the finer detail of the ice and "blood" in the pic. Shooting with a higher F-stop and not as much of an angle to the bowl would help to have more in focus.', '2010-02-08 21:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5859883, 851515, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and a lot of potential in the pic, but it comes off very soft. Not sure if it is the focus that is off, or if you just lost some clarity when you re-sized. I think some basic adjustments like levels, curves, saturation, contrast and sharpening could really spiff this up quite a bit.</td>', 'Nice idea and a lot of potential in the pic, but it comes off very soft. Not sure if it is the focus that is off, or if you just lost some clarity when you re-sized. I think some basic adjustments like levels, curves, saturation, contrast and sharpening could really spiff this up quite a bit.', '2010-02-08 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5859889, 850733, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty warm to me. Entered in the wrong challenge by accident?</td>', 'Looks pretty warm to me. Entered in the wrong challenge by accident?', '2010-02-08 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5859894, 851363, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of when I was in the AF, stationed in Germany and spent a couple of hours one night in a cherry picker, spraying de-icing fluid on a Starlifter. A cold, wet and unpleasant task.<br/> <br/>Extra pointage for stirring up memories.</td>', 'Reminds me of when I was in the AF, stationed in Germany and spent a couple of hours one night in a cherry picker, spraying de-icing fluid on a Starlifter. A cold, wet and unpleasant task. Extra pointage for stirring up memories.', '2010-02-08 21:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5860056, 850479, 112861, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but to me, the haloing around the branches says "sharpened too much".</td>', 'I like the composition, but to me, the haloing around the branches says "sharpened too much".', '2010-02-09 03:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
