(5861068, 851749, 67697, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the feeling of coldness (although I do wonder about the ghost person and ghost dog on the right).  But I think the pinching of the sun is pretty cooooool.</td>', 'I don''t really get the feeling of coldness (although I do wonder about the ghost person and ghost dog on the right).  But I think the pinching of the sun is pretty cooooool.', '2010-02-09 23:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
