(5861124, 851494, 25773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> This just made me laugh. Love the orange feet. Great composition! You deserve a bluebird!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you very much for the blue bird! She has brought me definitely happiness. It means a lot to me!<br/> <br/>Gyorgy</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: This just made me laugh. Love the orange feet. Great composition! You deserve a bluebird!  Thank you very much for the blue bird! She has brought me definitely happiness. It means a lot to me! Gyorgy', '2010-02-10 00:10:43.000000', NULL, 0),
