(5861458, 851721, 61222, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Love the composition and processing great job. Congrats on your Blue really does convey cold.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Love the composition and processing great job. Congrats on your Blue really does convey cold.', '2010-02-10 07:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861463, 851203, 7467, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the ribbon! As you can tell I like taking lighthouse shots. This one was very interesting, with the wave action and icy buildup around the jetty and lighthouse - and then the sun actually came out for 5 minutes (unusual in Michigan in the winter...). Wish that tree was not there...<br/>Thanks again,<br/>Drake</td>', 'Thank you all for the ribbon! As you can tell I like taking lighthouse shots. This one was very interesting, with the wave action and icy buildup around the jetty and lighthouse - and then the sun actually came out for 5 minutes (unusual in Michigan in the winter...). Wish that tree was not there...Thanks again,Drake', '2010-02-10 07:24:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861472, 851761, 3084, '<td valign="top">My Golden loves the snow too.  But, you have truly captured the true bliss that they have when romping around in the snow.  Well done.</td>', 'My Golden loves the snow too.  But, you have truly captured the true bliss that they have when romping around in the snow.  Well done.', '2010-02-10 07:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861473, 851744, 90495, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments folks. <br/> <br/>I too thought that the top was cut short but I had no choice, a shadow was there and had to be cropped out. I''m working on a clean version and I''m going to add some white space at the top to balance things out. I couldn''t do that in Basic Editing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-10 07:35:05.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments folks.  I too thought that the top was cut short but I had no choice, a shadow was there and had to be cropped out. I''m working on a clean version and I''m going to add some white space at the top to balance things out. I couldn''t do that in Basic Editing.', '2010-02-10 07:34:31.000000', '2010-02-10 07:35:05.000000', 0),
(5861477, 850390, 90495, '<td valign="top">Cool image and very well done.</td>', 'Cool image and very well done.', '2010-02-10 07:37:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861478, 851708, 90495, '<td valign="top">I liked this a lot in voting. Love the ice shapes.</td>', 'I liked this a lot in voting. Love the ice shapes.', '2010-02-10 07:39:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861513, 850645, 83313, '<td valign="top">I thought this might have been yours, but I wasn''t certain enough to leave a guess. I agree with some of the other comments, in spite of traits that some could see as flaws, it successfully captures and conveys the impression of how cold the day is. Got a 7 from me for making me shiver.</td>', 'I thought this might have been yours, but I wasn''t certain enough to leave a guess. I agree with some of the other comments, in spite of traits that some could see as flaws, it successfully captures and conveys the impression of how cold the day is. Got a 7 from me for making me shiver.', '2010-02-10 08:32:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861520, 850628, 114285, '<td valign="top">Thats pure magic, I didn''nt get to vote, but I surely would''ve given you a 10, totally awesome.</td>', 'Thats pure magic, I didn''nt get to vote, but I surely would''ve given you a 10, totally awesome.', '2010-02-10 08:38:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861523, 851607, 105457, '<td valign="top">Hi again Susan :)<br/>We continually meet (at least virtually)<br/> <br/>Composition<br/>Great crop, albeit a bit tight. It''s amazing though, how could you get so close with just a 10-20mm? You had to be right below him, so of course no snow appears.<br/>Yet, you still managed to capture the cold feeling required for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Technique<br/>Great stop-motion photo, perfect timing, and just superbly captured.<br/> <br/>Processing<br/>As you didn''t have any snow or distinctive features to add to the photo, the skier look a bit lonely. I see that there are hints of clouds in the sky, so I would probably would darken just the blue channel / tones, as to try and get a few clouds to appear in the sky. I think it would boost the overall image.<br/> <br/>Overall<br/>I gave it an 8 at voting, because it was one of the best in the challenge.<br/>An 8 average vote from commentators is also a very good score, and you managed a 6+ score in total. A job well done :)<br/> <br/>Take care,<br/>Joao</td>', 'Hi again Susan :)We continually meet (at least virtually) CompositionGreat crop, albeit a bit tight. It''s amazing though, how could you get so close with just a 10-20mm? You had to be right below him, so of course no snow appears.Yet, you still managed to capture the cold feeling required for this challenge. TechniqueGreat stop-motion photo, perfect timing, and just superbly captured. ProcessingAs you didn''t have any snow or distinctive features to add to the photo, the skier look a bit lonely. I see that there are hints of clouds in the sky, so I would probably would darken just the blue channel / tones, as to try and get a few clouds to appear in the sky. I think it would boost the overall image. OverallI gave it an 8 at voting, because it was one of the best in the challenge.An 8 average vote from commentators is also a very good score, and you managed a 6+ score in total. A job well done :) Take care,Joao', '2010-02-10 08:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861524, 851203, 33736, '<td valign="top">You''ve done what''s been on my To-Shoot List for quite some time - gotten gorgeous pictures of our beautiful Lighthouses in Winter.  Congratulations on a most special capture, and on the high placement in the Challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-10 08:47:36.</i></td>', 'You''ve done what''s been on my To-Shoot List for quite some time - gotten gorgeous pictures of our beautiful Lighthouses in Winter.  Congratulations on a most special capture, and on the high placement in the Challenge.', '2010-02-10 08:45:41.000000', '2010-02-10 08:47:36.000000', 0),
