(5861575, 851638, 61961, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be yours!  I always appreciate that you stay true to your own vision -- not to mention mother nature -- and don''t tart up the photos with over-the-top skies and colors.</td>', 'I thought this might be yours!  I always appreciate that you stay true to your own vision -- not to mention mother nature -- and don''t tart up the photos with over-the-top skies and colors.', '2010-02-10 09:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861577, 851203, 30861, '<td valign="top">YOu know, I''ve been looking at your portfolio, and every image you''ve done well with, has been shot in the bitter cold. I dub the "Icemaster Drake"... Nice job. I expected the same damned lighthouse from you, and was pleased to see something else :-)</td>', 'YOu know, I''ve been looking at your portfolio, and every image you''ve done well with, has been shot in the bitter cold. I dub the "Icemaster Drake"... Nice job. I expected the same damned lighthouse from you, and was pleased to see something else :-)', '2010-02-10 09:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861586, 851427, 33736, '<td valign="top">There is a sign on one of our Lake Michigan Lighthouse causeways which says, "In memory of those who died falling from this place, and those who died trying to save them."  I love these fabulous Wintry scenes, but wonder if placing yourself (and possibly someone else) in this perilous position was worth it.  There is a reason that one only sees these taken from a greater distance.<br/> <br/>Sorry for the lecture, but before and after reading your narrative, I was appalled by the danger in which you placed yourself.  <br/> <br/>Next time, instead of climbing the stairs as you plan, maybe you should safely use the super zoom lens you''re going to spend the next year saving for!  lolllllllll</td>', 'There is a sign on one of our Lake Michigan Lighthouse causeways which says, "In memory of those who died falling from this place, and those who died trying to save them."  I love these fabulous Wintry scenes, but wonder if placing yourself (and possibly someone else) in this perilous position was worth it.  There is a reason that one only sees these taken from a greater distance. Sorry for the lecture, but before and after reading your narrative, I was appalled by the danger in which you placed yourself.   Next time, instead of climbing the stairs as you plan, maybe you should safely use the super zoom lens you''re going to spend the next year saving for!  lolllllllll', '2010-02-10 09:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861589, 851607, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re doing sports/action now, too??  And very well, I might add!  Lots of energy to this shot, great detail, and that sweet pastel sky to top it all off.  Nicely done!</td>', 'You''re doing sports/action now, too??  And very well, I might add!  Lots of energy to this shot, great detail, and that sweet pastel sky to top it all off.  Nicely done!', '2010-02-10 09:20:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861618, 851498, 88371, '<td valign="top">Thank you to those who voted and commented.  jminso I appreciate the support.  I was hoping this would do much better as well, but I''m still improving my technique and photography skills so I''ll take it.<br/> <br/>At the very least this will look good in a frame on my wall!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-10 09:43:26.</i></td>', 'Thank you to those who voted and commented.  jminso I appreciate the support.  I was hoping this would do much better as well, but I''m still improving my technique and photography skills so I''ll take it. At the very least this will look good in a frame on my wall!', '2010-02-10 09:33:23.000000', '2010-02-10 09:43:26.000000', 0),
