(5861642, 851498, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  I thought the black and white treatment was perfect and you did a very good job with conveying that cold feeling.  The voters are a fickle bunch.  So ignore them and just keep on doing what you are doing and eventually they will catch up with you :)</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  I thought the black and white treatment was perfect and you did a very good job with conveying that cold feeling.  The voters are a fickle bunch.  So ignore them and just keep on doing what you are doing and eventually they will catch up with you :)', '2010-02-10 09:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
