(5861673, 850962, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition -- really gets the feeling of "cold" across.  But listen to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> -- crank up that shutter speed.  8P</td>', 'Beautiful composition -- really gets the feeling of "cold" across.  But listen to  Melethia -- crank up that shutter speed.  8P', '2010-02-10 10:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861695, 851758, 68947, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by salmiakki:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow.  I seriously expected this to ribbon.  It''s gorgeous. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so very much!  I had hoped that it would be at least a higher ranking but, comments like this made it very worthwhile! :) Thank you.</td>', 'Originally posted by salmiakki: Wow.  I seriously expected this to ribbon.  It''s gorgeous.   Thank you so very much!  I had hoped that it would be at least a higher ranking but, comments like this made it very worthwhile! :) Thank you.', '2010-02-10 10:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861704, 851721, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about cold looking! Fantastic photo, Rick. Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Wow, talk about cold looking! Fantastic photo, Rick. Congrats on the blue.', '2010-02-10 10:53:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861773, 850919, 113324, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PhotoInterest:</b></div><hr/><i> Whoa...that''s one cold bathroom!  This one actually shocked me and made me look for awhile.  I still can''t believe it! Really caught my eye and attention! :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the great comment, the bathroom is actually very warm and the nicest I''ve ever had. It doesn''t look any way near as stark as the photo. It needs to smartened up a bit but I like it and I like your comments, they made me smile.</td>', 'Originally posted by PhotoInterest: Whoa...that''s one cold bathroom!  This one actually shocked me and made me look for awhile.  I still can''t believe it! Really caught my eye and attention! :)   Thanks for the great comment, the bathroom is actually very warm and the nicest I''ve ever had. It doesn''t look any way near as stark as the photo. It needs to smartened up a bit but I like it and I like your comments, they made me smile.', '2010-02-10 11:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861788, 850919, 113324, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jminso:</b></div><hr/><i> This was one of my 10''s and I am surprised it didn''t finish higher. I nominate you for Posthumous Ribbons, part III </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the 10, it''s very much appreciated. I was actually very pleased with the scores. I knew it wouldn''t be to everyones taste so I''m not surprised at the low position. <br/> <br/>I suspect the younger ones and those that live in a warm climate won''t get it. Here in England I remember some bitterly cold baths in the 60''s and 70''s.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the nomination. Does it exist?</td>', 'Originally posted by jminso: This was one of my 10''s and I am surprised it didn''t finish higher. I nominate you for Posthumous Ribbons, part III   Thanks for the 10, it''s very much appreciated. I was actually very pleased with the scores. I knew it wouldn''t be to everyones taste so I''m not surprised at the low position.  I suspect the younger ones and those that live in a warm climate won''t get it. Here in England I remember some bitterly cold baths in the 60''s and 70''s. Thanks for the nomination. Does it exist?', '2010-02-10 12:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861791, 850919, 113324, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments I always appreciate feedback.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all your comments I always appreciate feedback. ', '2010-02-10 12:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861803, 850628, 3548, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2010-02-10 12:19:40.000000', NULL, 0),
