(5862080, 851774, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was pretty decent.  I gave it a 6.  I have to tell you tho, the first person I thought of when I saw this was Tom Cruise.  Hope you take that as a compliment lol.</td>', 'I thought this was pretty decent.  I gave it a 6.  I have to tell you tho, the first person I thought of when I saw this was Tom Cruise.  Hope you take that as a compliment lol.', '2010-02-10 15:15:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862299, 851774, 103142, '<td valign="top">Actually, it''s not all that bad! The funny thing is, the crop a little off center on the nose feels kind of strange. Not I have to go look where people crop the face when they cut it in half!<br/> <br/>lol, you still beat 18 people!</td>', 'Actually, it''s not all that bad! The funny thing is, the crop a little off center on the nose feels kind of strange. Not I have to go look where people crop the face when they cut it in half! lol, you still beat 18 people!', '2010-02-10 17:29:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862303, 851316, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think it''s so hard to get crystals! I tried the other day, and I think you really need a tripod. I love the background colors on this.</td>', 'I think it''s so hard to get crystals! I tried the other day, and I think you really need a tripod. I love the background colors on this.', '2010-02-10 17:32:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862309, 851607, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the movement on this--the colors, and especially the face gear the person''s wearing! Awesome shot!</td>', 'I love the movement on this--the colors, and especially the face gear the person''s wearing! Awesome shot!', '2010-02-10 17:33:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862320, 851749, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is very well done! It''s a very cool picture, I guess just not cold enough... :P<br/> <br/>Awesome shot, however.</td>', 'This is very well done! It''s a very cool picture, I guess just not cold enough... :P Awesome shot, however.', '2010-02-10 17:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862327, 850560, 103142, '<td valign="top">Definitely cold!! The crystal down in the lower left looks fascinating!</td>', 'Definitely cold!! The crystal down in the lower left looks fascinating!', '2010-02-10 17:35:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862330, 851640, 103142, '<td valign="top">This was so awesome -- incredible shot! I love the structure of the crystal, and that''s so hard to capture! Congrats on your top 10!</td>', 'This was so awesome -- incredible shot! I love the structure of the crystal, and that''s so hard to capture! Congrats on your top 10!', '2010-02-10 17:36:49.000000', NULL, 0),
