(5862365, 851721, 45596, '<td valign="top">I''m at a lost for words!  What''s primarily going through my mind right now is. Thank You, Thank You, and Thank You!!  Your scores and comments have been terrific!!<br/> <br/>This photo was shot in a small park next to the St. Lawrence River in Cape Vincent, New York.  On the horizon is Canada.  The temp that day was 6 degrees Fahrenheit.  I am so glad this did well.<br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/>Rick<br/></td>', 'I''m at a lost for words!  What''s primarily going through my mind right now is. Thank You, Thank You, and Thank You!!  Your scores and comments have been terrific!! This photo was shot in a small park next to the St. Lawrence River in Cape Vincent, New York.  On the horizon is Canada.  The temp that day was 6 degrees Fahrenheit.  I am so glad this did well. Thanks again,Rick', '2010-02-10 17:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862484, 850962, 74015, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the watercolor effect the movement blur is creating.  Against the white snow, it''s fabulous.</td>', 'I love the colors and the watercolor effect the movement blur is creating.  Against the white snow, it''s fabulous.', '2010-02-10 19:38:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862507, 850723, 90495, '<td valign="top">Poor little guy. I have squirrel friends too but my favourite one died, didn''t see him all summer long. :( He would sit on my shoulder while he ate the nuts I gave him. He was a very relaxed squirrel. I miss him. :)</td>', 'Poor little guy. I have squirrel friends too but my favourite one died, didn''t see him all summer long. :( He would sit on my shoulder while he ate the nuts I gave him. He was a very relaxed squirrel. I miss him. :)', '2010-02-10 20:01:10.000000', NULL, 0),
