(5862572, 851761, 39057, '<td valign="top">Great.</td>', 'Great.', '2010-02-10 20:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5862587, 850962, 61651, '<td valign="top">Welcome to the I-Get-No-Respect-For-Blurry-Shots Club!  Although I have to say, 4.9766 is quite a high score, considering.  :)  This image, by it''s very simplicity, benefits from that sense of movement from the blur.</td>', 'Welcome to the I-Get-No-Respect-For-Blurry-Shots Club!  Although I have to say, 4.9766 is quite a high score, considering.  :)  This image, by it''s very simplicity, benefits from that sense of movement from the blur.', '2010-02-10 20:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
