(5864974, 851721, 111773, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an amazing shot! I don''t even like the cold and snow, but I love how the water froze into icicles through the bench! Very dramatic shot.</td>', 'Wow, this is an amazing shot! I don''t even like the cold and snow, but I love how the water froze into icicles through the bench! Very dramatic shot.', '2010-02-12 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 0),
